# Models

- Inherit `BaseModel`. Docstring: `Model to declare …`.
- Every field: `verbose_name` + `help_text`. Every FK/O2O: explicit `related_name`.
- Choices live in `<app>/enums.py` — never nested on the model.
- Model create/change → update `<app>/admin.py` (`list_display`, filters, search, readonly).
{%- if cookiecutter.use_uuid_pk == "y" %}
- PK: UUID v4 on `BaseModel` — do not switch to sequential ints on domain entities.
{%- else %}
- PK: project default `BigAutoField` unless a model declares otherwise.
{%- endif %}

